  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 48",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hulira ekigambo eki ihanga lya Yakobo, inywe abetelerwa aha ibara lya Isiraeli; hulira inywe baijukuru ba Yuda. Munahira obuso bw'Omukama, mwebuga Ruhanga wa Isiraeli, kyonkai ebyo mugamba tibyo mukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwebuga okwo muli bazarwa b'ekigo kitakatifu, mugamba okwo mwesiga Ruhanga wa Isiraeli, ayetwa Omukama w'amahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebirabaireho nkaba mbigambire karai aka karai, nkabigamba inye nyenene nabimanyisa omu bantu, mara byaija byabaho kibandagara: Nkabikorakwo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbamanya inywe okwo mutalikugambirwa, nimugumangana emitima nk'ekyoma, emitwe mwina ey'omulinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigambo ebi nkabibagambira bugambira kwema karai bitakabaireho, omuntu ataija ahanyuma akagira ati, ‘Bikakorwa ekihuuku kyange, ekishushani kyange ekibaijano anga ekiheshano nikyo kyabihangire bikabaho.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Otura obihulira, mbwenu obilebe byona: N'aha tolikubikiliza? Kuruga kanya aka ndata kukugambira ebihya byonkai, ebishelekire eby'otamanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibaireho juba, ti bya irai: Kulemwa kugoba mambwenu obaire otakabihuliraga; otakugamba oti, ‘Mbaire nimbimanya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwema akarai kona toina ky'orahuliire, togira ky'omanya, okaigara amatwi. Namanyaga okwo otaliba mwesigwa n'akake, n'okwo oliba mushengi kushagulirana kwema kuzarwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyetanga ekiniga kulinda ekitinwa kyange. Tinigara kukubonabonyia nkakuchwa omu nsi nirwo abantu tulinsingiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, nkujugusire nawe tinkujugusire nka feza; nkubonesize enaku ezilikushusha etanuru y'omuliro nakulenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nimbikora aha rw'ekitinwa kyange, aha rw'ekitinwa kyange kyonkai; tinakukunda kukunukuruzibwa; taliho ondijo asaine kuhabwa kitinwa ekili kyange inye nyenkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mpuliliza iwe Yakobo, iwe Isiraeli ompulilize, nkakweta! N'inye Nyakubaho, ndi wa mbere, ndi wa nzindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi ekatondwa inye nyenene, n'eiguru likatondwa omu bushobora bwange. Kanyeta ensi eija, kanyeta eiguru lija.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muhurure inywena, muhulire! Ni ruhangaki arabagambiire ebigambo ebi? Endonkwa egyo Omukama nagigonza. Endonkwa egyo Omukama agitaireho kutatulira Babiloni, atere Abakalidayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'inye nagambire mara nkamweta. Mulesire, mara ebyo arakora byona biragenduka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungobe muhulire ekigambo eki:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
